  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Chairs are back on avatars, thats great! But now a new problem - \"get off me. Who are you? Get off me!\" Its unnerving to walk around in public and random guys sit on you (ive had 2 get creepy about it). Can we have the option in the vrchat menu to make our avatar chairs Public/Friends Only? By a button in the menu we can switch whenever we want. Switch to Friends Only if we dont want strangers on us or switch to Public if we dont mind the attention.",
